"Patterning Prisms": {
  "index": -96,
  "category": "constructs",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Patterning Prisms"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "The Patterning Prism is much more than an ingredient for the Lodestar.  It is capable of "
        },
        {
          "text": "copying logic",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " between "
        },
        {
          "text": "Lodestars ",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "(or "
        },
        {
          "text": "Delegation Stations",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "), as well as "
        },
        {
          "text": "copying data",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " between "
        },
        {
          "text": "Particle Emitters",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nIn addition, it "
        },
        {
          "text": "contains several simple templates for Construct logic that can be used to quickly set up basic logic flows",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".  It is capable of copying/pasting to/from the system clipboard, so it "
        },
        {
          "text": "can also be used to share logic flows across games or with other players",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nTo use all of this functionality, simply hold a patterning prism and use the radial menu, default 'Z'."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": []
}